WEBVTT

00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:09.833
Teacher, we're at the meeting point.

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:14.666
Fran!

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:17.125
Good morning! Did you sleep well?

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:20.957
Did you have a dream about me?

00:00:20.957 --> 00:00:24.000
Yes. It was a nightmare.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.542
That kinda hurts.

00:00:29.832 --> 00:00:32.082
Gather around, everyone.

00:00:32.082 --> 00:00:36.125
This investigation of the spider's nest

00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:40.207
will also serve as a promotion test
for two E-rank parties.

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:42.832
(Class: Duelist, Lv. 33)
My name is Cruise Riouselle.

00:00:42.832 --> 00:00:43.625
I am the leader

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:46.957
(Azure Guardians)
of the Azure Guardians, a C-rank party.

00:00:46.957 --> 00:00:50.832
A party led by a handsome blonde swordsman.

00:00:50.832 --> 00:00:52.292
(Rig, Class: Water Mage)
I, along with my party members,

00:00:52.292 --> 00:00:53.625
(Eizelle, Class: Bandit)
Rig and Eizelle,

00:00:53.625 --> 00:00:56.792
will oversee this operation
and act as examiners.

00:00:56.792 --> 00:00:58.332
I look forward to working with you all.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.542
Now, please introduce yourselves.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:08.457
(Krad, Class: Warrior)
The name's Krad.

00:01:08.457 --> 00:01:09.957
I am the leader

00:01:09.957 --> 00:01:11.957
(Dragon's Roar)
of the Dragon's Roar, an E-rank party.

00:01:11.957 --> 00:01:13.957
(Victor, Bart, Gennel)

00:01:13.957 --> 00:01:17.000
We'll sweep through this test.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.750
We came prepared!

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:20.707
That's all from us.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.792
What's his problem?

00:01:27.792 --> 00:01:30.957
(Furion)
I am Furion.

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:32.000
(Species: Wood Elf, Class: Elementalist"
A wood elf elementalist

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.792
like the guild master.

00:01:34.792 --> 00:01:37.250
But he looks rather plain.

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:41.082
(Forest Eyes)
I'm the leader of the E-rank party, Forest Eyes.

00:01:41.082 --> 00:01:42.667
The members of his party look ordinary too.

00:01:42.667 --> 00:01:44.875
My turn.

00:01:44.875 --> 00:01:47.250
I'm Amanda. Pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.042
I knew it! That person is Amanda!

00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:51.417
No way…

00:01:51.417 --> 00:01:53.917
Why would an A-rank adventurer join this quest?

00:01:53.917 --> 00:01:56.750
This is a D-rank quest, isn't it?

00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:59.792
It's no wonder the people are talking…

00:01:59.792 --> 00:02:04.582
No one would perceive her
to be here because of Fran.

00:02:04.582 --> 00:02:06.750
All that's left is you, young lady.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.417
I'm Fran.

00:02:08.417 --> 00:02:09.707
Rank D.

00:02:09.707 --> 00:02:11.667
I like curry.

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:13.332
Nice to meet you.

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:17.125
I don't think they know what curry is…

00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:19.375
So it's you, after all.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:24.167
The one who fawned over the guild master

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:26.125
to get promoted by him…

00:02:27.457 --> 00:02:29.500
The self-proclaimed D-rank brat!

00:02:38.042 --> 00:02:44.332
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:07.832
(Episode 9
The A-Rank Adventurer Is A Monster)

00:04:08.292 --> 00:04:10.792
Here come the ones
trying to pick a fight with us…

00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:13.542
I don't get you two at all.

00:04:13.542 --> 00:04:17.125
The A-rank old lady
who just came here to amuse herself,

00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:21.000
and the favorite brat
of that pedo guild master.

00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:27.500
Would you care to repeat that?

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:30.291
What did you just say?

00:04:30.291 --> 00:04:31.750
What are you doing?

00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:35.625
I'm sorry! I'm very sorry…

00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:36.750
- She's fast.
- Help…

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.166
- She came up right behind him in a flash.
- I think I see a flower field… What's this?

00:04:38.166 --> 00:04:40.083
Huh? Have I gone to the other side?

00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:44.000
Are you all right, Krad?

00:04:47.541 --> 00:04:49.500
It's one thing for Amanda…

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.666
But I'll never acknowledge someone
who uses their connections to climb the ranks!

00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:54.958
I did no such thing.

00:04:54.958 --> 00:04:56.233
Huh?

00:04:56.333 --> 00:05:01.666
Little brats like you
should go back to their mothers!

00:05:01.666 --> 00:05:03.958
My mother is dead.

00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:14.875
Miss Amanda is only here as an observer.

00:05:14.875 --> 00:05:17.458
If she does involve herself,

00:05:17.458 --> 00:05:19.750
she'll clear the quest in the blink of an eye,

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.708
and there will be no test whatsoever.

00:05:22.708 --> 00:05:24.625
Now, I will begin the briefing.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.125
Our objective is to investigate the dungeon

00:05:27.125 --> 00:05:31.750
under the Alessa guild's jurisdiction,
the spider's nest,

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:35.833
retrieve the crystals
generated by the dungeon core,

00:05:35.833 --> 00:05:39.958
and eliminate all monsters
we encounter in our path.

00:05:40.833 --> 00:05:42.916
They're just F-rank monsters, right?

00:05:42.916 --> 00:05:45.708
We might just accidentally wipe them out.

00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:48.708
The dungeon absorbs the powers of the monsters

00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:50.750
to sustain itself.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.791
So avoid killing all of them.

00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:55.166
But this is a dungeon with six floors.

00:05:55.166 --> 00:05:57.916
It won't be as easy as you think.
So caution is recommended.

00:05:57.916 --> 00:06:00.458
Without further ado,
let us set out for our destination.

00:06:16.541 --> 00:06:18.666
I heard this from Garrus yesterday.

00:06:18.666 --> 00:06:20.583
He said, a dungeon without a dungeon master

00:06:20.583 --> 00:06:24.708
will use its core
to generate monsters and crystals.

00:06:27.208 --> 00:06:33.166
The guild  periodically sends adventurers
to the dungeon to retrieve these resources.

00:06:33.166 --> 00:06:37.458
It's a source of profit,
so other countries also have their eyes on this.

00:06:44.958 --> 00:06:46.583
What is he doing?

00:06:46.583 --> 00:06:48.458
Maybe he wanted to take a dip.

00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:52.375
Shut up, you old hag!

00:06:52.375 --> 00:06:54.208
Krad!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:57.375
Curse you!

00:07:22.541 --> 00:07:24.583
We made it at last.

00:07:25.833 --> 00:07:28.666
It's because you guys kept fooling around

00:07:28.666 --> 00:07:31.041
that we arrived much later than scheduled.

00:07:31.041 --> 00:07:32.166
Tch.

00:07:33.041 --> 00:07:35.458
I didn't do anything.

00:07:35.458 --> 00:07:38.000
We'll head into the dungeon
early in the morning tomorrow.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.291
I take it that everyone
brought their sleeping equipment and food?

00:07:46.125 --> 00:07:48.000
As for the vigil,

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.500
Miss Fran, you're on the first watch.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.500
Got it.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.166
Followed by the Azure Guardians.

00:07:54.166 --> 00:07:56.041
Then, the Dragon Roar.

00:07:56.041 --> 00:07:57.791
And finally, the Forest Eyes.

00:07:57.791 --> 00:08:00.458
What about mighty Miss A-rank?

00:08:00.458 --> 00:08:02.541
Keeping vigil
is part of the test too.

00:08:02.541 --> 00:08:05.333
If we let Miss Amanda take part,
then it wouldn't be a test.

00:08:05.333 --> 00:08:06.541
So sorry.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.166
What is it?

00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:24.250
Can a little brat who used her connections
to get promoted actually keep watch?

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.458
Yes.

00:08:25.458 --> 00:08:27.958
And I didn't get promoted
because of my connections.

00:08:27.958 --> 00:08:29.250
In that case,

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.125
prove it!

00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:37.581
Show me if you really have
what it takes to stay in rank D!

00:08:37.581 --> 00:08:39.581
Battle me!

00:08:39.581 --> 00:08:42.178
Don't mind him, Fran.

00:08:42.178 --> 00:08:45.457
It would be best
not to get involved in any trouble.

00:08:45.457 --> 00:08:48.000
Hah! I knew it!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.875
Are you actually scared
even with that huge sword on your back?

00:08:51.875 --> 00:08:55.125
Or is that a toy sword just for show?

00:08:55.125 --> 00:08:58.917
If that's true,
you might as well throw that useless sword away!

00:09:04.417 --> 00:09:06.832
I can't pretend I didn't hear that.

00:09:07.957 --> 00:09:09.542
Fine.

00:09:09.542 --> 00:09:11.792
I'll battle you.

00:09:14.707 --> 00:09:17.082
Fran, are you serious about fighting him?

00:09:17.082 --> 00:09:20.917
He mocked you. I won't let that pass.

00:09:21.917 --> 00:09:24.000
A practice battle?

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.832
This should be interesting.

00:09:32.207 --> 00:09:34.750
No one's stopping this, huh?

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.417
Krad!

00:09:36.417 --> 00:09:38.707
Teach her a lesson!

00:09:38.707 --> 00:09:40.000
Of course I will.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.417
There's no way that
brat is actually eligible for rank D.

00:09:43.417 --> 00:09:46.292
I'll tear your facade into shreds!

00:09:46.292 --> 00:09:49.792
Those who rely on connections
to get promoted are the worst, aren't they?

00:09:49.792 --> 00:09:52.332
So whenever I come across someone like that…

00:09:52.332 --> 00:09:56.832
The dragon inside me screams!

00:09:56.832 --> 00:09:59.667
There it is! Krad's roar!

00:09:59.667 --> 00:10:01.082
So cool!

00:10:01.082 --> 00:10:02.832
I'm in awe!

00:10:02.832 --> 00:10:06.082
I used to enjoy
getting hyped up like this too…

00:10:06.082 --> 00:10:08.457
Let's set up wind and earth barriers

00:10:08.457 --> 00:10:11.457
so we can detect the presence
of any monsters, just in case.

00:10:11.457 --> 00:10:13.875
You're on watch duty right now, after all.

00:10:13.875 --> 00:10:15.167
Okay.

00:10:16.457 --> 00:10:20.875
Wind of the sky, guide us and protect us.

00:10:20.875 --> 00:10:24.375
Root of the forest, lend us
the perception of the earth

00:10:24.375 --> 00:10:25.625
and alert us.

00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:26.917
What?

00:10:27.917 --> 00:10:31.332
Wind Zone! Earth Zone!

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:39.582
What? Two elements?

00:10:39.582 --> 00:10:42.707
Even for a sword mage, that's impressive.

00:10:42.707 --> 00:10:45.042
What did you do?

00:10:45.042 --> 00:10:46.582
Keeping watch.

00:10:46.582 --> 00:10:47.832
Huh?

00:10:47.832 --> 00:10:49.375
Whatever.

00:10:51.042 --> 00:10:52.625
Bring it on.

00:10:59.292 --> 00:11:01.500
A sword, huh?

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:06.792
I've never lost against anyone
of the same rank with this spear.

00:11:06.792 --> 00:11:09.875
A sword is no match
for a spear regarding the range.

00:11:09.875 --> 00:11:13.125
I'll teach this shameless brat a lesson

00:11:13.125 --> 00:11:16.832
and show her that my spear
is far superior to her sword!

00:11:21.957 --> 00:11:23.000
Spear Technique!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.167
The spearhead instantly drew back to his hands!

00:11:25.167 --> 00:11:27.417
There it is! Krad's ultimate skill!

00:11:27.417 --> 00:11:29.250
Double Spear!

00:11:32.292 --> 00:11:34.957
What? She dodged both strikes!

00:11:37.167 --> 00:11:38.957
It was probably just luck.

00:11:38.957 --> 00:11:41.707
Spear Technique! Power Swing!

00:11:43.292 --> 00:11:44.292
Dang it!

00:11:44.292 --> 00:11:46.875
Double Spear!

00:11:48.207 --> 00:11:50.207
You're short of breath.

00:11:58.457 --> 00:12:02.457
Behold! The power of my super sword!

00:12:02.457 --> 00:12:04.292
Be amazed!

00:12:04.292 --> 00:12:08.457
Fran, I don't think you defeated him
with the sword per se…

00:12:09.417 --> 00:12:11.417
That hurt…

00:12:15.832 --> 00:12:19.500
The Back of Sword Strike!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:23.042
Actually, you're hitting him with the ridge, Fran.

00:12:23.042 --> 00:12:25.332
- Krad!
- Krad!

00:12:26.875 --> 00:12:30.250
That'll make them think twice
about challenging you.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.000
That was fun.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.417
That was an excellent battle, Fran.

00:12:36.042 --> 00:12:39.750
How about a practice battle with me too?

00:12:41.625 --> 00:12:43.582
With you…

00:12:48.042 --> 00:12:49.542
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:12:49.542 --> 00:12:51.542
How about a mock duel with me too?

00:12:51.542 --> 00:12:53.832
It's boring doing nothing all day.

00:12:53.832 --> 00:12:55.917
My shoulders are getting stiff.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:12:59.832
Okay.

00:12:59.832 --> 00:13:05.042
On one condition.
If I win, please stop bothering me.

00:13:05.042 --> 00:13:08.125
My, my! Aren't you confident?

00:13:08.125 --> 00:13:12.125
Very well. If I win…

00:13:14.792 --> 00:13:18.417
You shall call me "Mama".

00:13:18.417 --> 00:13:20.707
Then… I simply can't lose!

00:13:20.707 --> 00:13:23.292
Fran, I think you're digging your own grave here…

00:13:23.292 --> 00:13:25.375
She is an A-rank, after all…

00:13:25.375 --> 00:13:28.332
Hey, hey, Looks like that little girl

00:13:28.332 --> 00:13:31.792
is going to fight Amanda next.

00:13:31.792 --> 00:13:34.750
Teacher, don't assist me.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:35.792
Fran?

00:13:35.792 --> 00:13:38.042
I want to fight with my own strength

00:13:38.042 --> 00:13:41.875
and see how I fare against an A-rank.

00:13:41.875 --> 00:13:44.542
All right. Do your best, then!

00:13:45.542 --> 00:13:48.417
Have you prepared yourself, Fran?

00:13:55.625 --> 00:13:56.707
A whip…

00:13:56.707 --> 00:13:58.250
Not quite common, right?

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.582
(Magic Whip of Celestial Dragon Beard)
Magic Whip of Celestial Dragon Beard.

00:14:00.582 --> 00:14:03.125
(Skills: Weight Alternation, Length Control)
This whip and I are old friends.

00:14:03.125 --> 00:14:05.457
OK, now. I shall start attacking.

00:14:06.917 --> 00:14:09.542
Let's start with something easy.

00:14:13.332 --> 00:14:14.582
Take this!

00:14:17.667 --> 00:14:19.042
And this!

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.542
Not bad.

00:14:26.542 --> 00:14:29.582
When blocked by a sword,
the whip would tangle it.

00:14:29.582 --> 00:14:33.750
If Fran got careless,  Amanda might simply
pull the sword out from her hands.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:36.917
Did Fran rely on her survival instincts
to dodge her attacks within seconds?

00:14:36.917 --> 00:14:39.375
Good call, Fran! Well done!

00:14:41.375 --> 00:14:43.042
Hm… I wonder how

00:14:43.707 --> 00:14:45.832
you'll handle this?

00:14:48.457 --> 00:14:50.167
Krad!

00:14:50.167 --> 00:14:51.457
That brat…

00:14:51.457 --> 00:14:52.667
Look!

00:14:52.667 --> 00:14:54.000
That little girl is something!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:54.917
What…

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:22.707
She used the handle!

00:15:24.707 --> 00:15:26.457
That was close.

00:15:26.457 --> 00:15:29.457
You might actually get a hit in.

00:15:29.457 --> 00:15:32.167
I can't find a single opening to break through!

00:15:32.167 --> 00:15:33.832
Now, then,

00:15:33.832 --> 00:15:35.750
I think it's time for me to get

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.250
a little more serious.

00:15:40.917 --> 00:15:42.875
Mana flow!

00:15:48.582 --> 00:15:49.667
Whip Technique.

00:15:50.417 --> 00:15:52.417
Mizuchi Strike!

00:16:05.375 --> 00:16:09.582
So she can control the movements
of the whip with her mana flow.

00:16:09.582 --> 00:16:11.957
What's with those crazy movements of that whip!?

00:16:11.957 --> 00:16:15.250
It's as if that thing's alive and after its prey!

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:17.167
You're incredible, Fran!

00:16:17.167 --> 00:16:19.457
This is my one-hit-KO move!

00:16:19.457 --> 00:16:22.042
It has been a long time
since someone was able to dodge this!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.582
Oh, no!

00:16:37.917 --> 00:16:42.582
The power of the whip increased significantly
after it was infused with mana.

00:16:43.375 --> 00:16:44.667
It'll be bad for us if we drag this out.

00:16:44.667 --> 00:16:46.292
I know.

00:16:53.292 --> 00:16:56.042
Wind Magic. Wind Foot.

00:16:58.582 --> 00:17:01.082
A wind magic-based skill
that boosts your speed, I see.

00:17:01.707 --> 00:17:03.125
Parallel Thought!

00:17:03.125 --> 00:17:05.250
Fran is using Parallel Thought?

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.375
Is she planning to cast
different spells simultaneously?

00:17:08.163 --> 00:17:10.836
Unleash the flames of
the red lotus brighter than fire,

00:17:10.836 --> 00:17:12.163
and burn everything it touches!

00:17:12.163 --> 00:17:14.625
This has been most delightful, Fran!

00:17:14.625 --> 00:17:16.625
But it'll be over with this.

00:17:16.625 --> 00:17:18.836
Mizuchi Strike!

00:17:30.791 --> 00:17:32.625
She's still dashing forward!

00:17:32.625 --> 00:17:34.916
Air Burst!

00:17:34.916 --> 00:17:39.041
You used a blast of compressed air
to accelerate your speed even further!

00:17:39.041 --> 00:17:41.500
There isn't enough time
for her to pull her whip back.

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.583
Amanda is now defenseless!

00:17:48.666 --> 00:17:51.500
Wind Shield.

00:17:55.291 --> 00:17:56.791
I'm not finished yet…

00:18:04.708 --> 00:18:07.458
The spell she cast with Parallel Thought…

00:18:07.458 --> 00:18:10.916
Flare Blast!

00:18:11.708 --> 00:18:13.500
Oh, my…

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.541
What… Miss Amanda!

00:18:31.541 --> 00:18:35.291
It can't be! An A-rank adventurer was…

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:39.625
What the hell was that battle?

00:18:43.541 --> 00:18:47.625
You're magnificent, Fran!
I didn't expect you to do that!

00:18:48.625 --> 00:18:52.125
What? No damage?

00:18:52.125 --> 00:18:54.500
Spirit's Affection.

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.333
No way…

00:18:56.333 --> 00:18:59.041
I'm not done yet…

00:19:02.502 --> 00:19:03.625
Fran!

00:19:04.541 --> 00:19:06.875
I'm sorry! Forgive me!

00:19:06.875 --> 00:19:09.000
I overdid it…

00:19:15.375 --> 00:19:17.750
You did land the hit.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:22.541
But my unique skill,
Spirit's Affection, was activated by itself.

00:19:22.541 --> 00:19:23.833
(Render an attack)
A skill that can render

00:19:23.833 --> 00:19:25.000
(up to a certain power level ineffective once.)
an attack completely null?

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:26.625
(Cooldown: 24 hours)
That's too cunning!

00:19:30.708 --> 00:19:33.333
They're both monsters…

00:19:33.333 --> 00:19:36.500
Rig, use your water magic
to extinguish the flames!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.375
Everyone else as well. Put out the fire!

00:19:39.375 --> 00:19:43.625
That said, it's not good to use fire magic
in a place surrounded by trees.

00:19:43.625 --> 00:19:46.625
I'll need to have Fran apologize
to everyone later.

00:19:52.583 --> 00:19:55.958
You forced yourself to use Parallel Thought
that you dislike

00:19:55.958 --> 00:19:58.250
just to get Amanda
to stop playing around and fight you seriously.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.125
Besides Whip Technique and Wind Magic,

00:20:00.125 --> 00:20:04.500
you even forced her unique skill to activate.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.666
I suppose you could say
you've made your telling response.

00:20:07.958 --> 00:20:11.041
Fran…

00:20:11.041 --> 00:20:13.875
My dear Fran…

00:20:17.333 --> 00:20:19.541
For the future of the Black Cats

00:20:19.541 --> 00:20:21.875
and yourself,

00:20:21.875 --> 00:20:25.208
you must work hard, Fran…

00:20:25.208 --> 00:20:29.166
Huh? Mother…

00:20:32.875 --> 00:20:35.083
Oh, you're awake.

00:20:35.083 --> 00:20:37.000
Amanda?

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.541
You've been unconscious for nearly two hours.

00:20:39.541 --> 00:20:40.625
Teacher…

00:20:40.625 --> 00:20:43.666
It's all right. You should rest a little more.

00:20:43.666 --> 00:20:47.083
Cruise and the others
will keep watch in your stead.

00:20:47.083 --> 00:20:48.375
But…

00:20:48.375 --> 00:20:52.625
Your wounds have been healed,
but mentally, you're still fatigued.

00:20:52.625 --> 00:20:54.041
You're still a child.

00:20:54.041 --> 00:20:57.333
You should act spoiled
with adults every now and then.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:04.500
You're really strong, Amanda.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:06.000
You're not half bad yourself.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:10.000
But I fainted… It's my defeat…

00:21:11.041 --> 00:21:13.500
How honest.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.625
Do you still remember our agreement?

00:21:16.625 --> 00:21:17.666
Ah, that's right!

00:21:17.666 --> 00:21:20.916
Now, let's hear you call me "Mama".

00:21:24.791 --> 00:21:26.000
M…

00:21:27.166 --> 00:21:29.250
- Fran wants to keep her end of the deal,
- M…

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:32.916
- but she can't seem to bring herself to say it.
- M…

00:21:32.916 --> 00:21:34.583
M…

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:42.000
I went a little too far with my teasing.

00:21:43.333 --> 00:21:44.833
I know

00:21:44.833 --> 00:21:49.375
your mother is still with you in your heart.

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:53.791
I don't expect you to trust me right away,

00:21:53.791 --> 00:21:59.250
but I'll always be here for you.

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.875
You can rely on me.

00:22:01.875 --> 00:22:04.916
I've used Truth of Falsehood
to check several times.

00:22:04.916 --> 00:22:08.833
Not a word she said to Fran is insincere.

00:22:10.291 --> 00:22:12.208
She smells nice…

00:22:12.208 --> 00:22:15.708
So this is the Guardian of Children…

00:22:15.708 --> 00:22:18.083
I think I might be a little jealous.

00:22:22.416 --> 00:22:25.166
I'm sorry for using fire magic

00:22:25.166 --> 00:22:26.541
around a forest.

00:22:27.791 --> 00:22:33.583
Well, it's all right. We didn't expect
the battle to get that intense, either.

00:22:33.583 --> 00:22:35.958
So we're responsible as well.

00:22:35.958 --> 00:22:37.875
Thank you for keeping watch for me too.

00:22:37.875 --> 00:22:40.750
Not at all. Don't mention it.

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:41.916
You're hurt…

00:22:43.375 --> 00:22:45.291
Actually, after watching that battle,

00:22:45.291 --> 00:22:47.875
everyone was all fired up,

00:22:47.875 --> 00:22:50.250
and we challenged Miss Amanda too.

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:53.041
But no one managed to last as long as you did.

00:22:55.416 --> 00:22:58.583
Thanks to this, everyone knows
just what you're capable of now.

00:22:58.583 --> 00:23:02.166
We'll be counting on you
in the dungeon investigation.

00:23:02.166 --> 00:23:03.708
I'll do my best!

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:09.666
As you know, the spider's nest dungeon
is under the jurisdiction of the Alessa Guild.

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:16.416
Only the executives of the guild

00:23:16.416 --> 00:23:19.083
or adventurers holding a permit
may enter this dungeon.

00:23:22.208 --> 00:23:23.791
Now, let's go.

00:23:23.791 --> 00:23:26.208
Fran, let's take care of this

00:23:26.208 --> 00:23:29.125
and get the permit to
take on the next dungeon!

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:40.083
(Next Episode
The Trap of the Trap Spiders)
